Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:17.520
Cough!

6
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.272
Cough. Your turn!

7
00:00:23.172 --> 00:00:23.732
Cough!

8
00:00:24.032 --> 00:00:24.870
Great!

9
00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:26.699
Fever!

10
00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:29.299
Fever. Your turn!

11
00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:33.084
Fever!

12
00:00:33.384 --> 00:00:34.385
Super!

13
