17
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.356
Tummy ache!

18
00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:49.339
Tummy ache. Your turn!

19
00:00:52.239 --> 00:00:53.368
Tummy ache!

20
00:00:53.668 --> 00:00:54.646
