21
00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:56.941
Sore throat!

22
00:00:57.841 --> 00:01:00.064
Sore throat. Your turn!

23
00:01:02.964 --> 00:01:04.337
Sore throat!

24
00:01:04.637 --> 00:01:05.800
Good job!

25
00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:07.899
Runny nose!

26
00:01:08.799 --> 00:01:10.708
Runny nose. Your turn!

27
00:01:13.608 --> 00:01:14.702
Runny nose!

28
00:01:15.002 --> 00:01:16.096
Wonderful!

29
00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:18.038
Bandage!

30
00:01:18.938 --> 00:01:21.184
Bandage. Your turn!

31
00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.190
Bandage!

32
00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:26.409
